### اختبار نظام أسئلة المسابقات

### 1. إنشاء سؤال واحد (أدمن فقط)
POST {{baseUrl}}/competition-questions
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "competition_id": 1,
  "question_text": "Due to strong winds, the boat kept __________ in circles.",
  "option_a": "swimming",
  "option_b": "spinning",
  "option_c": "surrounding",
  "option_d": "span",
  "correct_answer": "B",
  "points": 1,
  "question_order": 0,
  "is_active": true
}

### 2. إنشاء مجموعة أسئلة دفعة واحدة (أدمن فقط)
POST {{baseUrl}}/competition-questions/bulk
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "competition_id": 1,
  "questions": [
    {
      "question_text": "Due to strong winds, the boat kept __________ in circles.",
      "option_a": "swimming",
      "option_b": "spinning",
      "option_c": "surrounding",
      "option_d": "span",
      "correct_answer": "B",
      "points": 1,
      "question_order": 0
    },
    {
      "question_text": "Publishers suffer significant losses as a result of book __________.",
      "option_a": "literacy",
      "option_b": "punishment",
      "option_c": "piracy",
      "option_d": "privacy",
      "correct_answer": "C",
      "points": 1,
      "question_order": 1
    },
    {
      "question_text": "It is cruel to __________ children by making them go hungry.",
      "option_a": "publication",
      "option_b": "publish",
      "option_c": "punish",
      "option_d": "compensate",
      "correct_answer": "C",
      "points": 1,
      "question_order": 2
    },
    {
      "question_text": "The show's success made her an overnight __________.",
      "option_a": "celebrate",
      "option_b": "celebrity",
      "option_c": "celebration",
      "option_d": "deliberate",
      "correct_answer": "B",
      "points": 1,
      "question_order": 3
    }
  ]
}

### 2.5. إنشاء أسئلة من نص بسيط (أدمن فقط)
POST {{baseUrl}}/competition-questions/text
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "competition_id": 1,
  "questions_text": "Due to strong winds, the boat kept __________ in circles.\nA) swimming\nB) spinning\nC) surrounding\nD) span\n\nPublishers suffer significant losses as a result of book __________.\nA) literacy\nB) punishment\nC) piracy\nD) privacy\n\nIt is cruel to __________ children by making them go hungry.\nA) publication\nB) publish\nC) punish\nD) compensate\n\nThe show's success made her an overnight __________.\nA) celebrate\nB) celebrity\nC) celebration\nD) deliberate"
}

# ملاحظة: الأسئلة يتم إنشاؤها بدون تحديد الإجابة الصحيحة
# يجب تحديد الإجابة الصحيحة لاحقاً باستخدام API تحديث الإجابة الصحيحة

### 3. الحصول على جميع أسئلة مسابقة معينة
GET {{baseUrl}}/competition-questions/competition/1

### 4. الحصول على أسئلة مسابقة مع تفاصيل إضافية (أدمن فقط)
GET {{baseUrl}}/competition-questions/competition/1/details
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 5. الحصول على سؤال بواسطة المعرف
GET {{baseUrl}}/competition-questions/1

### 6. تحديث سؤال (أدمن فقط)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/competition-questions/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question_text": "Due to strong winds, the boat kept __________ in circles. (Updated)",
  "correct_answer": "B",
  "points": 2
}

### 6.5. تحديد الإجابة الصحيحة للسؤال (أدمن فقط)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/competition-questions/1/correct-answer
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "correct_answer": "C"
}

### 7. تغيير حالة النشاط (أدمن فقط)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/competition-questions/1/toggle-active
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 8. تغيير ترتيب الأسئلة (أدمن فقط)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/competition-questions/reorder/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "questionOrders": [
    { "id": 1, "order": 3 },
    { "id": 2, "order": 0 },
    { "id": 3, "order": 1 },
    { "id": 4, "order": 2 }
  ]
}

### 9. الحصول على إحصائيات الأسئلة (أدمن فقط)
GET {{baseUrl}}/competition-questions/stats/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 10. حذف سؤال (أدمن فقط)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/competition-questions/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### متغيرات البيئة
# @baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
# @adminToken = your_admin_jwt_token_here

### ===== اختبارات واجهات الطالب =====

### 1. جلب مسابقات الطالب حسب صفوفه (طالب فقط)
GET {{baseUrl}}/competitions/student
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 2. اشتراك الطالب في مسابقة (طالب فقط)
POST {{baseUrl}}/competitions/1/join
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 3. تفاصيل المسابقة للطالب (بعد الاشتراك)
GET {{baseUrl}}/competitions/1/student-details
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### متغيرات البيئة للطالب
# @studentToken = your_student_jwt_token_here
